{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "icon-cloud",
  "title": "图标云",
  "description": "用于以可拖拽旋转的 Canvas 3D 球面展示一组图标的展示组件。",
  "category": "misc",
  "tags": [
    "canvas",
    "interactive",
    "tailwind"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "class",
      "type": "HTMLAttributes[\"class\"]",
      "required": false,
      "description": "作用于画布容器的额外类名。"
    },
    {
      "name": "images",
      "type": "string[]",
      "required": false,
      "description": "图标图片地址列表，会自动映射到球面节点。",
      "default": "() => []"
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "slots": [],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "path": "app/components/reborn/examples/icon-cloud/IconCloudDemo.vue",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "落地页展示技术栈、工具链等图标集合时。",
    "需要用户可拖拽旋转、点击节点聚焦的品牌矩阵展示。",
    "图标数量较多、希望在有限空间内立体呈现时。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "静态网格排列的图标墙，改用 animate-grid 或 bento-grid。",
    "横向滚动的品牌 Logo 展示，改用 reborn-marquee。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用，基于 Canvas 渲染。",
    "images 传图片 URL 数组，组件自动映射到球面节点；不支持传插槽内容。",
    "点击节点会自动旋转到正前方，拖拽画布可手动调整视角。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [],
  "install": {
    "cli": "npx reborn-ui@latest add icon-cloud"
  },
